History - table of the last 50 sessions overall (active and expired), same columns plus logout time (blank if still active). Most recent login first. Fixed count of 50, not time-boxed.

Clicking any row in either table navigates to that session's job history, filtered by session_id, showing which jobs were triggered during that specific login, with drill-through to a specific job's console.

